  "body": "Welcome to 8 Dulcie Way, Orewa – an impressive brand-new 345.80m² legal home and income where contemporary design, generous proportions and income opportunity come together in one outstanding package.\r\n\r\n•\tSave Time & Money – Deal Directly with the Builders! Call Arup from Golstruct Homes on 021 777 155 to make this your own.\r\n\r\nThe main home offers four generous bedrooms, 2 living areas plus a separate office, 3 bathrooms, 2 separate powder rooms making it ideal for larger families or those working from home. The spacious main living area features a gas fireplace, creating a warm and inviting centrepiece for the home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find a large family room alongside three spacious bedrooms, including the master bedroom where you can relax and enjoy beautiful sea views.\r\n\r\nThe separate two-bedroom minor dwelling features its own living area, kitchen and bathroom – perfect for additional rental income, extended family or multi-generational living.\r\n\r\nYour new home will include: \r\n\r\n•\t10 Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n•\t365 Days Maintenance Period\r\n•\tDouble glazing and insulation\r\n•\t2.7m stud at lower level\r\n•\tSolution Dyed Nylon Carpets\r\n•\tLED lights throughout\r\n•\tFloor to ceiling fully tiled bathrooms\r\n•\tLaminate Flooring\r\n•\tEngineered stone kitchen bench-tops with soft close drawers\r\n•\tDedicated office space\r\n•\tDucted air con system to main house and wall hung heat pump to minor dwelling\r\n•\tKwila deck, Patio, driveway and paths\r\n•\tFencing to neighbouring section\r\n\r\nAll Watercare, Council and Engineering fees included. Pricing excludes any phone connection charges/levies (if applicable), window treatments and planting. \r\n\r\nPLEASE CALL: Arup on 021 777 155 from Golstruct Homes for more info or visit us at our office on 5-6/ 177 Millwater Parkway, Millwater",
